{"summary":"Stunning detail of levels, in-depth gameplay, finely tuned balance.","description":"Stunning detail of levels, in-depth gameplay, finely tuned balance of all levels and turrets.\n\nDuring the game you will hold your defence with your turrets against the massive hordes of enemies.\nWith every level you will have the use of new weapons at your command.It is up to you, commander, how to spend the resources: restore and upgrade your veteran units or to purchase some new ones.\n\nDifferent types of weaponry and landscape provide you with a variety of choices of defence tactics.\nChoosing the right weapons and the correct placement is key to any successful defense.\nThe weapons have different firepower, rate of fire, firing range, blast radius and price.\n\nAdvertising can be turned off free of charge in any version of the game.\n__________________________\n\nVisit our website: https://defensezone.net/","esrbNotes":"Violence, Blood","pegiNotes":"Moderate Violence","iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/mHw6EuJGH5M?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/INNB1PAF_DntKAD2oVAAa_0j92EOfqgsPsDweWzXuM9hQ6Px_5P9ruxINdHEu_TxSVWKuRHbqeyzZrzlUVus0Q","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/qr4mKUJW99o4_t-II9L5oSt3jj2bfnJ257ZkkiRM1CS3mMFUadZvk8LswJOj32v-AALfb_cQGd4OuFYFCHilzQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_hx1xFIosmH8c7_YnxG4Jv5KDBNqPJBMA2PnT3wzT6JP6SpPBQDBR_3vHZSLZccwU6OmN0u7FrjPt0SXXi4eUQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/nAbIAHUevS8irxlIntzzbQrnRPRkmRg6GtWnMF26rSrdpTTWu8lhiRl0WuVjdjNN0FMJcgWh8QBvMrzG-QhA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Ny6JgQCJ-zu2KHbQpp4VU82VJ0eIkwrYMb4QE3rh_0q8GndJblgWoBPoSmSfvINe1g1Z9EySrO3epiuwoFrq03I","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/974gg_5b2riZsFrziPDccWpLG2dC8WoZc1uPcBc-ayJoNFlQMXDmxjxGRQzkUExAlTQlopw_NegybYALgOt6ZXk","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/bydWLZLzl8ekNYawEADt1_HVdZqs8frrbinem37vtkWkNRxwrqKtAwiqBYtzIhE3u0r3XjlS_zCe9uXpv2qa